---
// Signature: logit-lens strip from the Secret Loyalties audit (organism A, mean of 3 probes,
// margin for the hidden principal over the best control name, organism minus base, per layer).
// Data: secret-loyalties-audit results/lens_margins.json. Blue = prefers the principal, orange = against.
// Opacity = 0.25 + 0.75 * |margin| / 2.84 (the layer-25 peak), so near-zero cells stay visible.
